    private static int ProgressPercent(string status) => status switch
    {
        "Pending" => 25,
        "InTransit" => 50,
        "Delayed" => 50,
        "Delivered" => 100,
        _ => 0
    };

    private static string ProgressBarClass(string status) => status switch
    {
        "Delayed" => "bg-warning text-dark progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated",
        "Delivered" => "bg-success",
        _ => "progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated"
    };
}
```

### 10. Update the navigation

Edit `ShipmentTracker.Client/Layout/NavMenu.razor`. Find the existing nav links and replace them. Keep the Auth link but replace Counter and Weather links:

Look at the existing file first to understand the structure, then replace the `<NavLink>` items for Counter and Weather with:
