- All interactive components go in the `.Client` project
- The server project references `.Client`, not the other way around
- Use the `edit` tool for existing files and `create` tool for new files only
- Read existing files with `view` before editing to get exact content for replacements
- Make sure the `_Imports.razor` doesn't need updates (it should already have the necessary usings)

